WEBVTT

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:06.440
I miss you too.

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:33.730
Why haven't we noticed that before?

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:35.760
Because we're all so selfish.

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.500
I've noticed it a long time ago.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:38.960
Oh!

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:41.200
You're making a lot of money out of it.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.900
But the captain never said it himself.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:47.990
Yeah, I think that's the hard part about being a captain.

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:50.380
We should be the ones to say it.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:51.920
Huh?

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:58.240
Huh? What's wrong?

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.700
You're so relaxed.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:01.680
It's as if we're all talking about the race.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:06.260
Captain, we were actually talking about your vacation.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:09.280
My vacation?

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:11.560
Yes. The captain has been denied by Matt.

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:12.700
He's never taken a vacation.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.510
Vacation, huh? I'll give it to Kaiju.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:20.550
But it's true that you should give it to your wife or children.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:23.950
Right, everyone?

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:26.520
Captain, that's a big deal.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.540
If you want to get drunk, let me rest.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.800
You want me to tie you up with a rope?

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.000
Yes, you can tie me up with a rope.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:39.490
No, thank you.

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:44.200
Actually, my wife told me many times.

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:46.500
She hasn't been out for three years.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.560
Where is your wife's house?

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:52.870
It's near Hatsune-ko in Shinshu.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:53.550
Yes.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.420
In the middle of February,

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.940
God gave me an ice-cold mask.

00:02:57.920 --> 00:02:59.800
At that time, I felt something strange.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:00.080
What's that sound?

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:03.280
It's just the temperature dropping and the ice cracking.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:09.690
My wife sometimes wants to hear that sound, so she can't wait to hear it.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:13.740
Captain, have a safe trip.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:14.420
Have a safe trip.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:15.600
It's okay if I'm not here.

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:21.000
I see. I'll take your order.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:25.560
I'll be right back.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:44.510
Listen, I didn't take a day off because I wanted to do whatever I wanted to do.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.480
I took it because the crew forced me to.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:50.140
I'll go home after a night.

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:51.540
Yes, yes, I understand.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.690
What? That's boring.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:54.870
Well...

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:58.140
With Matt's condition, you shouldn't take a day off.

00:03:58.740 --> 00:03:59.570
That's the truth.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:00.810
I got it.

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:01.880
I'm sorry.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.510
I can't go to the capital.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:29.470
Captain Ibuki of the Bat.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:33.850
Did you have a good time with my home-papa?

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:44.930
Come on, Iruku.

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:46.340
It's only been a few years.

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:48.640
Take it easy.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:50.380
Here you go.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.360
Oh, that's enough.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:52.880
Yes.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.860
Actually, Yoko and Minako...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:05.250
I have to take a day off for that, but business is business.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.390
No, no, don't worry about it.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:15.540
My daughter is the captain of the MAD, and she's very good at acting.

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:22.010
When Minako grows up, will she become the wife of the MAD people?

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.480
No, I don't like that.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:28.750
I'm the only one who has a lot of MAD.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.320
No, it's not like that.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.800
If you don't become Matt's wife,

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:35.750
you won't become Matt's staff member.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.870
Well, you're a girl, after all.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.610
But I'm a female staff member.

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:46.900
Well, you can marry an ordinary man.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.010
That way, your father will be at ease.

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.460
No, I'm a woman river.

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:53.740
What a surprise.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.240
He was a soldier, and now he's Matt.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:58.760
It's strange that Matt could become a girl's dream.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:06.130
Mom, let's go.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:08.520
The gods won't be able to see us anymore.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.280
That's right.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.140
It might be better to go out now.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:13.940
Yes.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:15.370
It's cold this year,

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.980
so it might be faster for the gods.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.020
That's right.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.660
Then let's go.

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:21.200
What about you?

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:26.250
The gods will only break the ice.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:29.680
I'll just sleep for a while.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.620
I'd appreciate it if you let me go.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:34.100
It's boring. Let's go together, Dad.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:36.700
No, Minako. Your father is tired.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:38.810
Let's go together.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:39.250
Let's go.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:50.170
It's too warm, and the gods are finally here.

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:53.040
No matter what happens this year, we'll have to come.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.700
It's a good sign that the gods will come.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.080
Be careful on your way.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:08.680
This is the best spot, isn't it?

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:11.540
Thank you.

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:14.650
Asune, what is the god of the shrine?

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:19.020
It's the god of war.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.960
Minako, if you're going to be a member of MAD,

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:24.580
you have to pray for him to become stronger.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:28.020
If he becomes the top of the list, we'll be in trouble.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.240
There's no excuse for a mistake when the captain's not around.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.520
We'll just have to check on the captain's whereabouts.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:39.650
It's a long day off. Let's take it easy.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:41.990
Shinshu is a good place to drink.

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:43.540
Let's have a drink at Kawasakana.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:47.060
Everyone, get on patrol!

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:48.700
Yes, sir!

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.000
Let's go!

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:21.440
All right, now. If we get the captain, Matt will be in big trouble.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:54.300
Headquarters. Headquarters.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.160
Headquarters.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:58.860
Ibuki, is everyone all right?

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:02.870
Captain, we're all on patrol right now.

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.080
There's nothing wrong with us.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:06.420
Captain, we're taking a break.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.930
Please don't worry too much.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:11.310
I'm afraid of being a habit.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:14.570
It's better to talk to me like this.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:21.080
He's drunk, but he still keeps in touch.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.040
What a bad captain.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.510
Mama, you're still not coming?

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.610
I'm getting sleepy.

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:41.190
You'll have to wait a little longer.

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:43.480
Come on, let me carry you.

00:10:00.572 --> 00:10:01.572
Thank you.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:04.980
It was a good job.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.410
I'm sure we'll have a good harvest this year.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:11.120
Are you sure?

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:12.040
Yes.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:14.920
Because you can't see God in human eyes.

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:16.210
What?

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:17.390
What?

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:09.450
Ms. Ibuki, this way is safe.

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:09.970
Please.

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:10.650
I'm sorry.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:26.140
I'm sorry.

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:53.230
They call me Motokurashi.

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:59.320
You're too serious, Ibuki.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:02.110
What are you doing with our names?

00:13:38.240 --> 00:13:41.390
This is Matt. Oh, Captain Ibuki.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.950
A monster appeared in the first cat.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:44.240
Get out of here right now!

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.030
Captain! Captain!

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:54.090
There's a monster in the first cat!

00:13:57.470 --> 00:13:59.660
Captain, please wait.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:04.350
Ladies and gentlemen, I'm in charge of Mrs. Ibuki and Minako.

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:10.780
If you two die, Matt will be dismissed.

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.650
Destroy the shipyard headquarters.

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:21.140
Matt is in the way of making the Grotesque Seijin friends with the Earth.

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:26.300
24 hours...

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:33.500
It's the life of a man.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.130
It's the equipment of a man.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:38.940
Think about it.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:42.880
The damage the body gives to the village.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:11.260
Captain!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:18.170
My rest has been given to the聖人.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:23.410
No, we were the ones who advanced.

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:24.850
The bad guys are the聖人.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:28.140
Captain Batz was secretly watching the fire!

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:29.280
Isn't that right?

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:31.200
They're monsters, they're monsters!

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:33.080
We're no longer the group!

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:37.780
Even if you say that, the captain's wife and daughter are his children.

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:40.400
You don't have to be so stubborn!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:41.920
Did you know about us?

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:42.540
What?

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:44.020
Why are you making such a fuss?

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:45.060
What the hell are you doing?

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:47.780
What the hell are you doing?

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:48.560
We're so embarrassed.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:53.200
I understand.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:57.260
I will do my best to keep you all in line.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:03.400
All right, we'll trust the captain.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.700
All right, let's go.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:05.690
Let's go.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.610
Let's go.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:08.510
Let's go.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:11.430
Captain!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.640
They're right.

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:20.120
To save this village and Matt...

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:35.900
Don't be afraid, Minako.

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:38.220
I'll be with you forever.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:44.100
I'm not afraid of you. But where are you going?

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.910
I'm going to a faraway land.

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:51.490
Don't cry.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:55.710
A grown-up man can't cry.

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:04.080
If it's a full day, there's still half a day until midnight.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.550
Let's find them.

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:09.410
No, we don't need them.

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:12.220
If we don't take care of the sea monsters,

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:15.480
Matt won't apologize to the people of the land.

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:16.020
Is that so?

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.920
If we take care of the aliens, the monsters will disappear.

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:20.960
There's no doubt the aliens are taking care of them.

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:07.400
Captain, the two of you will die.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:08.380
I won't!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:11.560
Kill them.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:31.650
You're fighting a monster, aren't you?

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:34.800
I'll take care of the rest of their lives.

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:51.720
The monster looks exactly like the one in Hasune Shrine.

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:55.810
I thought it was Oyashiro Ogan.

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:58.530
The monster is in the shrine?

00:19:58.190 --> 00:19:58.690
I don't have the will to do that.

00:20:03.676 --> 00:20:04.596
Hehehehe!

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:41.320
Captain, I'm sure those two are safe.

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:44.060
All right, let's help Ultraman.

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.600
I know that if you defeat the Seijin, it will be the end of everything.

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:37.420
I'm so glad.

00:23:37.880 --> 00:23:38.900
I'm so glad.

00:23:39.140 --> 00:23:40.180
Are you all right?

00:23:40.360 --> 00:23:40.680
Miyako!

00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:41.440
Captain.

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:48.160
It's you, isn't it?

00:23:52.470 --> 00:23:56.890
When you're busy, you take a break from work.

00:23:56.890 --> 00:23:57.660
That's how it is.

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:07.460
Captain, what's going on?

00:24:08.100 --> 00:24:09.980
He fell on the lake's ice.

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:14.500
Did the gods control the monster?

00:24:16.940 --> 00:24:28.940
This is the end of the case.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:30.420
Why don't we thank the gods?

00:24:31.580 --> 00:24:40.180
He's looking back.

00:24:40.460 --> 00:24:42.420
The gods are embarrassed.

00:24:46.720 --> 00:24:47.960
Let's go.

00:25:09.950 --> 00:25:12.590
I fell in love with someone I shouldn't have loved.

00:25:13.330 --> 00:25:15.420
In the suffering of the aliens Akane and Kishida,

00:25:16.420 --> 00:25:18.380
Ultraman and Granadas continue to fight.

00:25:19.100 --> 00:25:20.290
Ultraman is in danger.

00:25:20.680 --> 00:25:21.380
Come on, let's all watch it next week.
